s part of the\n  same benchmark campaign and report as AC-2; splitting would duplicate the\n  instrumented runs. The P2 label reads as relative value, not a deferral\n  signal.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":73825,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab8e00735ca33645","agent_id":"a0c69221424ccf6a8","session_id":"afd4d759-6499-44cb-acf8-c98d0b579249","uuid":"133ea777-063a-4928-8360-e9f8cd32c2f6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:11:14.784Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8004 into epics"}
